{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Run Walk Run Timer 是一款專為跑步與步行交替訓練設計的計時工具，適合從休息中恢復、初試 Couch to 5K，或希望刷新馬拉松個人紀錄的用戶。App 可配合 iPhone 與 Apple Watch，以語音提示、震動回饋和即時數據引導每一步，現正限時免費，原價 US $0.99。</p>\n\n<h2>靈活間歇與手錶整合</h2>\n<p>App 可按時間或距離設定跑步與步行循環，並可在同一訓練中混合兩種模式。Apple Watch 提供即時心率、距離與配速，並以震動提示切換跑步或步行。每次訓練都會同步至 Apple Health，亦支援 5K、10K、半馬與全馬訓練計劃。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-88-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-89-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-90-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-91-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-92-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-93-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Run Walk Run Timer</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-04T20:39:21.684286+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":341,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}